{
  "title": "Kinesis Data Streams · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "실시간 레코드 스트림을 샤드 단위로 저장·소비한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Kinesis Data Streams</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#streams-shards-and-records\">Streams, Shards and Records</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#partition-keys-and-ordering\">Partition Keys and Ordering</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#provisioned-mode\">Provisioned Mode</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#on-demand-standard\">On-demand Standard</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#on-demand-advantage\">On-demand Advantage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#shared-throughput-and-enhanced-fan-out\">Shared Throughput and Enhanced Fan-out</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Kinesis Client Library and Checkpoints</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#retention-and-replay\">Retention and Replay</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\">Amazon Data Firehose and Managed Service for Apache Flink</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>30 / 62</span></div><h1>Kinesis Data Streams</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Kinesis Data Streams는 시간 순서의 Record를 보존하고 여러 Consumer가 독립적으로 읽게 하는 Streaming 서비스다. Consumer가 읽었다고 Record가 즉시 삭제되지 않으며 Retention 범위에서 다시 읽을 수 있다.</p><p>Producer는 Record를 기록하고 Consumer는 자신이 처리한 위치를 관리한다. 순서는 Shard·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a> 범위에서 설계하며 여러 Shard 전체에 단일 전역 순서가 자동 생기지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"독립적인 Consumer 위치\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>독립적인 Consumer 위치</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Consumer A</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Stream records</strong><small>Retention 동안 보관</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a> A</strong><small>실시간 처리 위치</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Alerts</strong><small>A의 속도로 진행</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Consumer B</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Same stream records</strong><small>읽어도 즉시 삭제 안 됨</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a> B</strong><small>B의 독립 위치·Replay</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Analytics</strong><small>다른 처리 속도 허용</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Shard 내부 순서와 여러 Shard 전체 순서를 구분한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"streams-shards-and-records\"><h2>Streams, Shards and Records<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#streams-shards-and-records\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Stream은 Shard로 구성되고 Record는 Data Blob·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>·Sequence Number 등을 가진다. Shard가 읽기·쓰기 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a> 단위다. 큰 Record·작은 Record의 요청 수가 각각 다른 한도에 영향을 줄 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"partition-keys-and-ordering\"><h2>Partition Keys and Ordering<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#partition-keys-and-ordering\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>의 Hash가 Record의 Shard를 결정한다. 같은 Entity의 순서를 유지하려면 Key와 Producer의 재시도·전송 방식을 설계한다. 한 Key에 트래픽이 몰리면 Shard 전체 여유와 무관하게 Hot Key가 된다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"provisioned-mode\"><h2>Provisioned Mode<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#provisioned-mode\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Shard 수를 직접 계획하고 Split·Merge 등으로 용량을 조정한다. 예측 가능한 트래픽과 세밀한 분산 제어에 비교한다. Capacity를 줄이거나 늘리는 동안 Consumer의 Shard 발견·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a> 동작을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"on-demand-standard\"><h2>On-demand Standard<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#on-demand-standard\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>서비스가 Shard Capacity를 자동 관리하고 사용량에 따라 과금한다. 과거 Peak보다 급격히 증가하거나 단일 Key가 한도를 넘으면 Throttling이 발생할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-demand</a>가 Retry·Key 분산 설계를 없애지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"on-demand-advantage\"><h2>On-demand Advantage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#on-demand-advantage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 계정 단위 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-demand</a> 모델로 Warm <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>과 다른 과금 구조를 제공한다. 최소 사용 약정이 있으므로 지속 사용량과 비교한다. 작은 간헐적 Stream에 무조건 더 저렴한 선택은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"shared-throughput-and-enhanced-fan-out\"><h2>Shared Throughput and Enhanced Fan-out<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#shared-throughput-and-enhanced-fan-out\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기본 Consumer는 Shard의 읽기 Capacity를 공유한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#shared-throughput-and-enhanced-fan-out\">Enhanced Fan-out</a>은 등록 Consumer별 전용 읽기 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>과 Push 방식 수신을 제공한다. Consumer 수·Mode별 한도와 비용을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\"><h2>Kinesis Client Library and Checkpoints<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">KCL</a>은 Shard Lease·Consumer 분산·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a>를 관리하도록 돕는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a>는 해당 앱이 처리한 위치이며 다른 독립 앱의 위치와 다르다. 장애 후 재처리로 중복 Side Effect가 생기지 않게 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"retention-and-replay\"><h2>Retention and Replay<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#retention-and-replay\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Retention 동안 Record가 보관되고 Consumer는 지원 위치·시각부터 다시 읽을 수 있다. 늦은 Consumer가 Retention을 넘으면 필요한 Record를 잃는다. 장기 보관은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 등으로 별도 저장한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\"><h2>Amazon Data Firehose and Managed Service for Apache Flink<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\">Data Firehose</a>는 지원 목적지로 데이터 Delivery·Buffer·Transform을 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\">Managed Service for Apache Flink</a>는 Stateful Stream 처리·Window 분석에 사용한다. Stream 저장, Delivery, 실시간 계산의 역할을 구분한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>장비 ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>로 보내 장비별 Event 순서를 관리한다. 실시간 경보 앱과 분석 앱은 독립 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\">Checkpoint</a>로 같은 Stream을 읽고 장기 자료는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 보관한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>여러 샤드 전체에 하나의 전역 순서가 보장되는 것은 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/streams/latest/dev/introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">streams/latest/dev/introduction.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/streams/latest/dev/how-do-i-size-a-stream.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">streams/latest/dev/how-do-i-size-a-stream.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q075/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q075\" data-question=\"Q075\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q075</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q075/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Several analytics consumers must independently read real-time click records and replay them within a retention period. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q075\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q075\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q075\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Kinesis Data Streams</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q075\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A one-time Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis</a> 스트림은 레코드와 소비자별 읽기 위치, 보존 기간 내 재읽기를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis Data Streams</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q073\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q073\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q092\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q092\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q071\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q071\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q072\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q072\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">이전 용어 <b>Internet Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">다음 용어 <b>KMS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
